abstract: >-
  Comenta is a suite of Shiny applications developed by IDISBA to facilitate
  annotation and collaborative commenting of scientific documents with
  Artificial Intelligence support (Gemini Flash and local Ollama). It includes
  four specialized applications: PDF annotation with PyMuPDF, HTML document
  annotation with automatic interpretation, PNG graphics annotation, and a
  collaborative mode with SQLite database. The package integrates AI features
  for interpreting, analyzing, recommending, and summarizing scientific content,
  with automatic biomedical term linking to PubMed, NCBI, and UniProt.
